# The Vercel deployment only needs: app.py, model/ (predictor.py,
# live_price.py, live_quotes.py, __init__.py - NOT train_model.py),
# models/, templates/, public/, feature_utils.py, data/processed/
# price_history.csv + recent_market_window.csv, and requirements.txt.
# Everything below is only needed for local development / the offline
# retraining pipeline and would just bloat the serverless function bundle
# (Vercel's Python function bundle limit is 500MB unzipped).
data/raw/
data/processed/merged_dataset.csv
data_pipeline/
model/train_model.py
requirements-dev.txt
*.ipynb
.github/
.git/
